## Then: a case whose defect depends on RUNTIME STATE the source does not contain
Actual bytes in a data file (BOM, stray space, duplicate key), an environment or
library difference, an ordering that only appears at scale. The code must look
correct because it IS correct, given assumptions the data breaks.
bugfix-notest's decoy has this shape by accident, which is why it is the only
place the reproduce-before-editing lever has ever shown an effect.

